  "order": "Case order above; alternate B0/Y1 and Y1/B0 by case index; sequential measured processes. Async runs only after synchronous acquisition/controls.",
  "repeats": "One deterministic acquisition per arm; three fresh sequential repeats of mass-1-30/90 for timing only. Repeat one anchor for exact physical-channel determinism. Timing excluded from deterministic comparisons.",
